 satisfying the two required conditions and having exactly \\(k\\) sunny lines (Section\u202f2).\n\nHence the set of admissible values of \\(k\\) is precisely  \n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\,0\\le k\\le\\Bigl\\lfloor\\frac{n-1}{2}\\Bigr\\rfloor\\, } .\n\\]"
